      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To detect text appearing inside an image, I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a concrete external provider. I will import the necessary module from the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Amazon Textract client to call the detect_text API. The provider will be identifiable in the code by the import statement and the use of the Amazon Textract client. </thinking>\n",
